          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Sono compatibili i temi di Typora e qualunque CSS che usi #write o .markdown-body. Il tema scelto si applica sopra la base di sistema.": {
      "extractionState": "manual",
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Typora themes and any CSS that targets #write or .markdown-body are supported. The chosen theme is applied on top of the system base style."
          }
        },
        "fr": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Les thèmes Typora et tout CSS qui cible #write ou .markdown-body sont pris en charge. Le thème choisi s'applique par-dessus le style de base du système."
          }
        },
        "de": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Typora-Themen und jedes CSS, das #write oder .markdown-body anspricht, werden unterstützt. Das gewählte Thema wird über den Systemstil gelegt."
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Se admiten los temas de Typora y cualquier CSS que use #write o .markdown-body. El tema elegido se aplica sobre el estilo base del sistema."
          }
        },
        "ar": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "تُدعم سمات Typora وأي CSS يستهدف #write أو .markdown-body. تُطبَّق السمة المختارة فوق النمط الأساسي للنظام."
          }
        }
      }
    },
